  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be three unit vectors such that <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is not parallel to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> , then the angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is",
